        <source src="/media/shum-brain/shum-brain-graph.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        Your browser does not support HTML video.
      </video>
      <figcaption>The graph turns the archive into a navigable 3D map, with clusters, labels, media previews, and direct access to source records.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="graph-model">
